{"id":"e2d33622-7c37-4641-9571-df86cbd7552e","object":"chat.completion","created":1785006298,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    core = case['core_distance']\\n    distances = case['distances']\\n    \\n    # Build list of edges with mutual reachability\\n    edges = []\\n    for u, v, d in distances:\\n        if u > v:\\n            u, v = v, u\\n        w = max(core[u], core[v], d)\\n        edges.append((w, u, v))\\n    \\n    # Sort by weight, then by endpoints (already canonicalized)\\n    edges.sort(key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1], x[2]))\\n    \\n    # Union-Find\\n    parent = {n: n for n in nodes}\\n    rank = {n: 0 for n in nodes}\\n    \\n    def find(x):\\n        while parent[x] != x:\\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\\n            x = parent[x]\\n        return x\\n    \\n    def union(x, y):\\n        rx, ry = find(x), find(y)\\n        if rx == ry:\\n            return False\\n        if rank[rx] < rank[ry]:\\n            parent[rx] = ry\\n        elif rank[rx] > rank[ry]:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n        else:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n            rank[rx] += 1\\n        return True\\n    \\n    mst_edges = []\\n    total_weight = 0.0\\n    target_edges = len(nodes) - 1\\n    \\n    for w, u, v in edges:\\n        if union(u, v):\\n            mst_edges.append([u, v, w])\\n            total_weight += w\\n            if len(mst_edges) == target_edges:\\n                break\\n    \\n    if len(mst_edges) != target_edges:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"Graph is disconnected, cannot form MST\\\")\\n    \\n    return {'mst_edges': mst_edges, 'total_weight': total_weight}\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to write Python source for solve(case) that returns mst_edges and total_weight according to the schema. The case payload has nodes (list of strings), core_distance (dict from node to float), distances (list of [node, node, float]). Compute mutual reachability for each pair: max(core[node1], core[node2], distance). Then build MST using Kruskal. Sort edges by weight, then by (min endpoint, max endpoint) lexicographically? The description says: \"Sort by reachability then endpoint IDs.\" For tie-breaking: \"All ranking and traversal ties use the source position or identifier specified above; never depend on hash-map iteration.\" So we sort edges by (weight, node1, node2) where node1 < node2. Then run union-find. Ensure graph is connected? If not, raise ValueError.\n\nReturn list of edges (each edge is [node1, node2, weight]) and total_weight sum.\n\nWe need to handle float precision; just sum as given.\n\nImplementation must not mutate case. Use only standard library.\n\nOutput must be JSON object with keys mst_edges and total_weight.\n\nNow produce the final answer with a single JSON object containing \"implementation\" as a string of Python code. Ensure proper escaping.\n\nWe'll write solve(case) that extracts nodes, core, distances. Compute all pairs from distances? Note: distances may not include all pairs? In given fixtures, it includes all pairs. But we should compute from distances list. Also ensure we only process each undirected pair once.\n\nWe'll create list of edges: for each [u,v,d] in distances, compute mutual_reachability = max(core[u], core[v], d). Then sort by (mutual_reachability, u, v) where u<v.\n\nThen initialize union-find dict for nodes. Iterate sorted edges, if find(u)!=find(v) then union, add edge to mst_edges, add weight to total_weight. Stop when mst_edges length = len(nodes)-1. If loop ends without enough edges, raise ValueError (disconnected).\n\nReturn {\"mst_edges\": mst_edges, \"total_weight\": total_weight}.\n\nEdge list should be list of lists each [node1, node2, weight] where node1<node2? The schema says prefixItems: [string, string, number]. So order must be preserved as computed. But we can output in the order they were added (sorted by weight then endpoints). That's fine.\n\nNow produce the final JSON."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2017,"completion_tokens":1016,"total_tokens":3033,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1920},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":530},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1920,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":97},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}